The data file in this directory, four_model_stability.csv, is released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The code in this package is released under the MIT licence, in the LICENSE file
at the repository root. This directory carries its own licence because the
file here is data rather than code.

It holds the worked case of the method paper, 4 models by 14 matched conditions,
with a main-run rate, a re-run rate and the calls behind each. It contains no
participant data, no provider payloads, no prompts and no raw call logs.
